WEBVTT

00:11:29.017 --> 00:11:33.439
we can make COVID-19 the last pandemic,

00:11:33.439 --> 00:11:38.193
and we can build a healthier,
more equitable world for everyone.

00:11:38.777 --> 00:11:39.945
Thank you.

00:11:39.945 --> 00:11:46.618
(Applause)

00:11:53.500 --> 00:11:55.169
Helen Walters: Thank you so much.

00:11:55.794 --> 00:11:57.463
I have a few follow-up questions

00:11:57.463 --> 00:12:00.424
and one is really
about the formal status of GERM.